    "title": "Flag Football Recap: Carrollton's Win on Wednesday Extends Winning Streak to Four - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Team Reports ,\n10 hours ago Carrollton came tearing into Wednesday's matchup with three straight wins (a stretch where they outscored their opponents by an average of 20.3 points), and they left with even more momentum. They came within six points of losing the streak, but they secured a 13-7 W against the Villa Rica Wildcats. For the Trojans, this counts as revenge for the 13-0 victory the Wildcats walked away with the last time they faced one another back in October of 2024. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
